  "_readme": "The shipped HUD layout. Press F4 in game to drag it, which writes user://hud_layout.json \u2014 that file wins over this one. To make a hand-placed layout the default, copy it over this file. Anchors are the nine of a 3x3 grid; an offset is measured to the box's matching edge, so a bottom_right box keeps its bottom-right corner a fixed distance from the screen's, and a centre box measures centre to centre. Plates are placed against the screen; items are placed against their plate's interior, which is the plate minus its painted brass frame.",
